*** Keywords ***
Get Pucch Mode Select
    ${CURRENT_SCF}                  OAM Get SCF File
    ...                             oam=${GNB_DU.oam}            file=SCF_DU_Current.xml
    SCF StartSession                scf_file=${CURRENT_SCF}
    ${dist_name}                    Set Variable                 MRBTS-${MRBTS_ID}/NRBTS-${NRBTS_ID}/NRCELL-${NRCELL_ID}
    ${pucchModeSelect}              SCF Get Single Value         ${dist_name}           pucchModeSelect    aicListEntity=Vdu    scope=both
    SCF StopSession                 scf_file=${CURRENT_SCF}
    Dated Log new line              pucchModeSelect is ${pucchModeSelect} for NRCELL ${dist_name}
    Set Suite Variable              ${pucchModeSelect}

Attach UE Multi
