Start Traffic Multi UE with Filter
    [Documentation]     Cannot use callback capture L1L2 because we need filter on pcap.
    [Arguments]         ${testParam}
        FOR      ${idUE}      IN RANGE      1        ${testParam.seq.totalUE}+1
         ${ueProfile}       Copy Dictionary       ${UE_PROFILE${idUE}}
         Traffic UE                               throughput=${testParam.seq.throughput}
         ...                                      duration=${testParam.seq.trafficDuration}
         ...                                      shouldBeStop=${testParam.seq.stopTraffic}
         ...                                      ueSetting=${ueProfile}
         ...                                      dir=${testParam.seq.dirTraffic}
         ...                                      deviation=${testParam.seq.deviation}
        END
    Dated Log                                     FILTER_TRAFFIC=${testParam.filtermsg}
    ${CaptureBIPTrafficGNB}                       Capture Bip Traffic            airscaleType=${GNB_DU}
    ...                                           captureName=${testParam.captureName}
    ...                                           filtermsg=${testParam.filtermsg}
    Set Test Variable                             ${CaptureBIPTrafficGNB}
    Capture Start                                 ${CaptureBIPTrafficGNB}
    sleep                                         ${testParam.seq.captureDuration}s
    Capture Stop                                  ${CaptureBIPTrafficGNB}
    Dated Log                                     CaptureBipGnb=${CaptureBIPTrafficGNB.path}
    [Return]                                      ${CaptureBIPTrafficGNB.path}

Start Traffic Multi UEs with Filter UL DL
